  ^{:line 30} [^{:val 3988292384 :doc "IEEE is by far and away the most common CRC-32 polynomial.\nUsed by ethernet (IEEE 802.3), v.42, fddi, gzip, zip, png, ...\n"} IEEE 0xedb88320]




